@startuml
title Activity 05 - Fraud High Value Transfer (incident response style)
start
|TxnStream|
:Receive high-value TRANSACTION event;
|FraudEngine|
:Score event using behavior model;
if (Score above threshold?) then (yes)
  :Trigger FRAUD_ALERT;
else (no)
  :Allow normal processing;
  stop
endif
|CaseMgr|
:Open and assign investigation case;
|OpsConsole|
:Review customer and transaction history;
while (More evidence needed?) is (yes)
  :Request additional traces/device data;
  |FraudEngine|
  :Recompute risk with new evidence;
  |OpsConsole|
endwhile (no)
:Contact customer for verification;
if (Customer confirms transfer?) then (yes)
  :Disposition = legitimate;
else (no)
  :Disposition = fraud suspected;
endif
fork
|CoreAPI|
:Release or block transaction;
fork again
|NotifySvc|
:Notify customer outcome;
fork again
|AuditSvc|
:Persist incident audit trail;
end fork
stop
@enduml
